### Test Owner Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "owner01",
  "password": "YOUR_OWNER_PASSWORD"
}

### GET ALL APPOINTMENTS
GET http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN


### CREATE NEW APPOINTMENT
POST http://localhost:3000/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patient_id": 1,
  "doctor_id": 3,
  "procedure_type": "Dental Cleaning",
  "booking_type": "Online",
  "appointment_datetime": "2026-11-24 11:30:00"
}


### UPDATE APPOINTMENT STATUS
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/appointments/10/status
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointment_status": "Completed"
}


### GET DOCTOR AVAILABLE SLOTS
GET http://localhost:3000/api/doctors/slots?doctor_id=3&date=2026-11-24
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN


### LOGIN AS RECEPTIONIST
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "recep01",
  "password": "YOUR_RECEPTIONIST_PASSWORD"
}


### TEST RECEPTIONIST ACCESS TO OWNER-ONLY ENDPOINT
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/appointments/10/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

{
  "appointment_status": "Completed"
}


### TEST ACCESS WITHOUT TOKEN
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/appointments/10/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointment_status": "Completed"
}


